Output demo.gif

Require tmux

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 20
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.2

Hide
Type "tmux -L clauxdemo attach -t demo"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "/Users/marcos/src/github.com/sonirico/claux/target/release/claux --console"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Screenshot list.png

Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 600ms

Enter
Sleep 2s

Screenshot focus.png

Ctrl+q
Sleep 800ms

Type "m"
Sleep 2500ms

Type "m"
Sleep 800ms

Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
